{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24458","headline":"书事咏怀 · 白居易","name":"书事咏怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官俸将生计，虽贫岂敢嫌。\n金多输陆贾，酒足胜陶潜。\n牀煖僧敷坐，楼晴妓卷帘。\n日遭斋破用，春赖闰加添。\n老向欢弥切，狂於饮不廉。\n十年闲未足，亦恐涉无厌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}